 - `shipments.get_shipment(shipment_id)`: fetch one shipment
 
+## invoices
+
+- `invoices.hold_invoice(invoice_id)`: pause collection on an open invoice; sets status to `on_hold` and stamps `held_at`. Raises `DomainError` with `E_NOT_FOUND` for an unknown invoice and `E_BAD_STATE` if the invoice is not open.
+
 ## rates
 
 - `rates.quote(weight_kg, zone)`: price for a weight and zone
